      "mechanic_id": "COMBAT_CRITICAL",
      "bucket": "networking_runtime",
      "text": "This directory contains `ExecutionUnit.cs`, a single but critical class that encapsulates everything needed to run a chunk of x86 code within a module: a CPU core, registers, memory reference, exported module dictionary, and interrupt handlers. ExecutionUnits are the mechanism that enables nested subroutine calls without corrupting CPU state."
